# FLEET TYPE DECLARATION — canonic-canonic.github.io
# This file IS the type system. Every allowed filetype must be declared.
# The compiler reads this file and rejects any file not matching.
# Add a type here = allow it in the fleet. Missing = compile error.
#
# GOV-first: .gitignore is the deploy boundary type gate.

# ── Default: deny all ──
*

# ── Infrastructure (extensionless) ──
!.gitignore
!CNAME

# ── Declared file types ──
!*.md
!*.json
!*.jsonl
!*.pdf
!*.svg
!*.png
!*.mmd
!*.js
!*.html
!*.yml
!*.txt

# ── Directory traversal (git requires explicit dir un-ignore) ──
!*/
